                        "text": "<p>Expect at least 8 to 12 weeks before visible skin changes. That's the timeline used in the research. Some customers notice hydration earlier from the Hyaluronic Acid. Hair and nail changes take longer. If you've tried collagen before without results, the formula was probably the issue, not you. A complete formula with the right dose and ingredients, may make the difference.</p>",
